removes: the comparison reads only the domains stored restricted, so a message skipped as restricted under a rule added after it was stored is never found
packages: ./worker/internal/backfill/pass2
tests: TestARuleAddedAndRemovedDuringThePassReachesTheTransition
scheduled-count: no
integration: yes

